  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Line a terracotta dish with parchment paper.",
    "Arrange the red snapper fillets in the dish.",
    "In a separate pan, melt the mantecare butter and sauté the onion, carrot, and peas until tender.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, mash the potato in a separate bowl and mix in the milk, cheddar cheese, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Pour the mashed potato mixture over the red snapper and top with the cooked vegetable mixture.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes, or until the top is golden brown.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot."
